From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] win32u, wow64win: accessibility SPI sets

SPI_SETSTICKYKEYS/FILTERKEYS/TOGGLEKEYS/MOUSEKEYS/ACCESSTIMEOUT/SOUNDSENTRY/
SERIALKEYS/HIGHCONTRAST keep their settings (registry-backed, as the other
sysparams), and the GETs read them back. CORE: integrator must review
(patches/notes/5216.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---

